</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/28b9d6ac-a25f-11f1-ad80-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-27T174421Z-1713022927-RC257NAEUFQT-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/28b9d6ac-a25f-11f1-ad80-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-27T174421Z-1713022927-RC257NAEUFQT-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">0e6b9970-a2ff-11f1-bcb6-09f3474c9d4c</guid><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 16:39:35 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/28b9d6ac-a25f-11f1-ad80-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-08-27T174421Z-1713022927-RC257NAEUFQT-RTRMADP-3-USA-TRUMP.jpg">REUTERS - Evan Vucci</source><dc:creator>华盛顿特约记者 陈米亚</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>泰国新规生效：当局警告“惹事生非”的游客将被驱逐出境</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260828-%E6%B3%B0%E5%9B%BD%E6%96%B0%E8%A7%84%E7%94%9F%E6%95%88-%E5%BD%93%E5%B1%80%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A-%E6%83%B9%E4%BA%8B%E7%94%9F%E9%9D%9E-%E7%9A%84%E6%B8%B8%E5%AE%A2%E5%B0%86%E8%A2%AB%E9%A9%B1%E9%80%90%E5%87%BA%E5%A2%83</link><description>
